.TH QUIPU-EXPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-export \- Export RDF from ROOT, one graph, a provenance group or a CONSTRUCT query
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu export\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-group\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-construct\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export RDF from ROOT, one graph, a provenance group or a CONSTRUCT query
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-group\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-construct\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
